# Keep build contexts small and keep local secrets/artifacts out of images.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache

# Never ship local environment files into an image layer.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

.git
.github
*.md
!README.md

# Local model artifacts and large assets.
**/.voira
**/*.mlx
